@Tickify.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7003

### Log in as the demo user and copy the token from the response
POST {{Tickify.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@tickets.local", "password": "User123!" }

### List upcoming events (paste the token after "Bearer ")
GET {{Tickify.API_HostAddress}}/api/events?page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=date
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json
